# ALLOW-LIST. Everything in this folder is private by default — your config, the search index, logs, screenshots,
# note lists, launchd files, one-off scripts. Only the files named below can ever be committed.
# Adding a new code file? Add a "!" line for it on purpose, after checking it holds nothing personal.
/*
/*/

